WEBVTT

00:00:58.054 --> 00:01:02.100
a local nonprofit
that fights human trafficking

00:01:02.141 --> 00:01:03.267
took up her case.

00:01:04.268 --> 00:01:06.312
They approached Sugi's school

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:09.440
and requested proof that she had attended.

00:01:09.941 --> 00:01:15.321
Here is the certificate, issued in 2017,

00:01:15.321 --> 00:01:18.533
10 years after her disappearance.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.160
It bothered me

00:01:21.202 --> 00:01:26.124
that the disappearance of a poor girl
doesn't matter to anyone,

00:01:26.124 --> 00:01:27.333
except her family.

00:01:29.544 --> 00:01:31.379
I'm a photojournalist,